  "description": "A collection of short stories showing the moment when accidental encounters turn into magical ties. \"Ju-Chan\", who is trying to find the soul of a cat that left for heaven, and \"Ji-Su\", a mysterious girl who followed him. \"Harry\", who went on a trip after losing a beloved friend, and \"Chie\", a child who resembles that friend.\n\nContains:\n1. **Yeoreum Anseseo** (여름 안에서)\n2. **Panorama** (파노라마)\n\n*Note: Gold Award winner in the 16th Japan International Manga Award.*",
